        "created_at": "2015-01-13T19:48:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Though I don't ahve the cards in front of me now, I've just heard what they do, has anyone tried a game with&nbsp;<span>\"Overcharged Systems\" (from&nbsp;</span><span><strong>Omnitron IV</strong> deck) +&nbsp;</span><span>\"Break the Rules\" ( from&nbsp;</span><span><strong>Wager Master</strong>&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span>Sub-Zero Atmosphere (from&nbsp;</span><span><strong>Absolute Zero</strong>'s deck) are in play?</span></p><div dir=\"ltr\">Especially depending on the order. This looks like something that can be a hell of a time!</div>",
