        "raw": "<p>Though I don&#39;t ahve the cards in front of me now, I&#39;ve just heard what they do, has anyone tried a game with&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&quot;Overcharged Systems&quot; (from&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Omnitron IV</strong> deck) +&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&quot;Break the Rules&quot; ( from&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Wager Master</strong>&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Sub-Zero Atmosphere (from&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Absolute Zero</strong>&#39;s deck) are in play?</span></p><div class=\"kl\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\":1d8\">Especially depending on the order. This looks like something that can be a hell of a time!</div>",
