        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-13T20:30:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would be a very weird game, but wouldn't be too hard to deal with in terms of rules interpretations, as none of those cards interact with each other.&nbsp; Overcharged Systems only effects Environment turns, Break the Rules only effects Hero turns, and Sub-Zero Atmosphere ony affects Villain turns.</p>",
